{"displayStem":"71세 남자가 CRT 삽입6개월 뒤에도 운동 시 숨참이 지속되어 평가받는다. 체액 과부하는 없고 약물치료는 안정적이다. 기기의 양심실 조율 집계는99%이다. 전문의가 동기화 기록을 검토하였다. 아래는 합성 사건 모식도이며 실제 파형을 재현한 그림은 아니다. 가와나의 시간축은 각각 해당 주기의 시작을0으로 두었다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"c03-p1-panels\"><svg class=\"c03-p1-figure\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 447\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"동기화 사건 시점 모식도. 실제 심전도 파형이 아님\"><text x=\"10\" y=\"32\" class=\"c03-p1-caption\">가. 기준 조율 주기</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"72\">우심실 출력</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><path d=\"M50 110v-24m-5 7l5 -7 5 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"50\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RV</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"166\">좌심실 출력</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"194\" y2=\"194\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><path d=\"M50 204v-24m-5 7l5 -7 5 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"50\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LV</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"260\">QRS 시작</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"288\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><path d=\"M97 280l7 8 -7 8 -7 -8Z\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"97\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Q</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"342\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"50\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"50\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"167.5\" x2=\"167.5\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"167.5\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50</text><line x1=\"285\" x2=\"285\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"285\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><line x1=\"402.5\" x2=\"402.5\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">150</text><line x1=\"520\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"520\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">200</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\">시간 (ms)</text></svg><svg class=\"c03-p1-figure\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 447\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"동기화 사건 시점 모식도. 실제 심전도 파형이 아님\"><text x=\"10\" y=\"32\" class=\"c03-p1-caption\">나. 반복 관찰 주기</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"72\">우심실 출력</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><path d=\"M167.5 110v-24m-5 7l5 -7 5 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"167.5\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RV</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"166\">좌심실 출력</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"194\" y2=\"194\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><path d=\"M167.5 204v-24m-5 7l5 -7 5 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"167.5\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LV</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"260\">QRS 시작</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"288\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><path d=\"M50 280l7 8 -7 8 -7 -8Z\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"50\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Q</text><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"342\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"50\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"50\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"167.5\" x2=\"167.5\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"167.5\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50</text><line x1=\"285\" x2=\"285\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"285\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><line x1=\"402.5\" x2=\"402.5\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">150</text><line x1=\"520\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"342\" y2=\"347\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"520\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">200</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\">시간 (ms)</text></svg></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>추가 관찰</th><th>결과</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>나의 QRS 형태</td><td>감독하 출력 억제 때의 자발 QRS와 동일</td></tr><tr><td>전극 검사</td><td>양측 임피던스와 수동 포획역치는 이전과 유사</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}